#: includes/settings-page.php:521
msgid "Maximum Token Age"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:532
msgid "A submission carrying a token older than this is rejected, so a token cannot be captured once and replayed indefinitely. Increase this if visitors on your site often take a long time before submitting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:540
msgid "Block REST API Comments"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:546
msgid "Reject comments submitted directly through the REST API (wp/v2/comments)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:549
msgid "The honeypot and JS token checks above only cover the classic comment form; REST API submissions bypass them entirely. Enable this only if your site does not rely on a headless app or other legitimate client that posts comments via the REST API."
msgstr ""

