#: includes/settings-page.php:754
msgid "CSS Trap Rotation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:760
msgid "Randomize the CSS technique and field order used to hide honeypot traps on every render."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:763
msgid "Makes it harder for CSS-aware bots to learn a single fixed pattern. Traps remain invisible to humans either way."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:771
msgid "Headless Browser Detection"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:777
msgid "Flag common automation signals (navigator.webdriver, zero-size browser window) picked up by the JS token script."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:780
msgid "Lightweight, client-side only, no external calls. Disable this if you use browser-automation tools to test submissions on your own site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:788
msgid "Require Real User Interaction"
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:794
msgid "Also require at least one real mouse, keyboard, touch, or scroll event before the form is accepted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/settings-page.php:797
msgid "Catches bots that simply wait out the JavaScript Token Delay instead of interacting with the page. Off by default; works best with a JavaScript Token Delay of at least 1-2 seconds."
msgstr ""

